title: <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> Breaks Toleration!
subtitle: We have angered the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Social Democrats**</span> too much...
new-page: true
view-if: dvp_in_government and spd_toleration and spd_patience < 0 and dvp_r < 50 and not constructive_vonc
tags: event

= <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> Breaks Toleration!

The <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span> has called for a vote of no confidence.

- @try_assuage: Try to assuage the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**SPD**</span>.
- @let_it_happen: Let the vote happen.

@try_assuage

How do we assuage the <span style="color: var(--spd-color);">**Social Democrats**</span>?

- @welfare: Increase welfare spending.
- @resources: Use our resources to reduce dissent within the coalition.
- @let_it_happen: Never mind. Let the vote happen.

@welfare
view-if: budget >= 1
subtitle: -1 Budget
on-arrival: spd_patience += 25; workers_spd += 5; unemployed_spd += 5; old_middle_dvp -= 5; old_middle_z -= 3; nationalist_dissent += 15; industrialist_dissent += 15; labor_dissent -= 5; progressive_dissent -= 5; labor_strength += 5; progressive_strength += 5; welfare += 1; budget -= 1; unemployed -= 2; dnvp_relation -= 10 if dnvp_left < 0;

Fine. We enacted a massive reform to increase welfare, in order to maintain the stability of our coalition. The vote has been called off.

@resources
choose-if: resources >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have enough resources.
subtitle: -2 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 2; spd_patience += 25;

By transferring resources to our coalition partners, we can reduce their dissent against our policies. This is a crude, but effective solution.


@let_it_happen
on-arrival: spd_in_government = 0; spd_toleration = 0; in_grand_coalition = 0; in_bourgeois_coalition = 1; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time + 3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; spd_toleration = 0; nationalist_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 5; new_middle_dvp -= 2; rural_dvp -= 2; old_middle_dvp -= 2; catholics_dvp -= 2; old_middle_z -= 2; rural_z -= 2;

The vote succeeds, and our government has resigned. Chancellor [+ chancellor +] remains as the head of a caretaker government, but no longer has the power to enact new policies.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
